Subject: Change Approval request - CRQ000000618661

Hi Steve and Leavy
Problem Statement
In the past month during high volume trading periods the staff assisted channels, branches and digital platforms experienced slow performances and timeouts on the flexi funeral product impacting customer experience.

Solution
The SBIB IT and SaaS service provider (MobiLife) isolated the performance issue for which a fix has been developed. Our SBIB colleagues have completed the testing earlier today and has provided signoff to proceed. The fix is ready for deployment into production ahead of this weekend high volume period as preventative measure. The deployment is scheduled for deployment tonight.

Business signoff and dispensation has been attached to the change.

@Andrew, Steve S<mailto:Steve.Andrew@standardbank.co.za>, your CIO approval is requested.
@Ricketts, Leavy L<mailto:Leavy.Ricketts@standardbank.co.za>, SA CAB approval is requested.

Regards,
Shane

